    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Kastelan Robot Maniple" hidden="false" id="bf37-b8a8-7c5b-30f1" publicationId="4fe1-8588-pubN65537" page="64" collective="false">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Kastelan Battle Protocols" id="eeeb-557a-34cf-b36f" hidden="false" publicationId="4fe1-8588-pubN65537" page="65">
          <description>Kastelan Robots always begin the battle with Aegis Protocol active. As long as the unit have at least one Cybernetica Datasmith, you can change to a new Battle Protocol at the end of your turn. The new Battle Protocol becomes active at the start of your next turn.

· Conqueror Protocol: Kastelan Robots can&apos;t shoot, but have their Attack characteristic doubled.
· Aegis Protocol: Kastelan Robots have Feel No Pain special rule.
· Protector Protocol: Kastelan Robots can&apos;t move, run or assault, but fire the carapace-mounted weapon twice.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <entryLinks>
        <entryLink import="true" name="Cybernetica Datasmith" hidden="false" id="b226-c6da-986c-f6c2" collective="false" targetId="042b-52e7-b5a8-23e8" type="selectionEntry"/>
