                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">When charging friendly units within 6&quot;, chargers do not get bonus charge attacks unless charged unit was already locked in combat or Gone to Ground.</characteristic>
