      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Fleshbane" id="0b83-b1e7-dcc3-6ef1" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="3897-5e71-1b57-57ba"/>
        <infoLink name="Rad-Phage" id="8aea-36f5-ecdf-58d1" hidden="false" type="rule" targetId="8bfd-42ae-5a40-a914"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Radiation Beam" id="186e-d30b-cf64-c1a6" hidden="false">
          <description>draw a 1mm wide line from the end of the gun barrel up to the listed range of the weapon. All friendly models (friend or foe) suffer a hit from the weapon, expect models with fly. Units with any models in the beam receive a number of hit equal to the number of their models caught in the path. If a piece of terrain, vehicle, or Model with 6 or more starting wounds is hit by the beam the beam stops causing d3 hits against the model instead of 1. If a transport suffers a penetrating hit the occupants suffer d6 str 2 hits with fleshbane in addition to the other effects.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
